{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"35735330-6090-4b6b-85bc-a89c3d78e584","agentId":"a09009e70701a4229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Repo C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers. Python .venv\\Scripts\\python.exe. No subagents, no COM3; ≤4 suites. You own cuore/web/static/*.css, templates/base.html (font links in <head> only), cuore/tests/check_type_scale.py, check_theme.py. You may commit and push (`github` main only; never koch-mcp/) and restart cuore (MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:/Users/User/mcp-servers/start-cuore.ps1 -Restart -Page /). Report under 100 words.\n\nOwner's correction: the typography pass (commits ed31772..9cc0de0, 2026-10-14) replaced the font faces; CUORE's design principle is the Alfa / Maserati / Ferrari marque look that was established earlier. Restore the font FAMILIES exactly as they were before that pass and keep only the new size scale. Steps: `git show 6a4d988:cuore/web/static/cuore.css` (the last commit before the typography pass) — extract every font-family declaration and the --sans/--mono/--display (or similarly named) tokens, the hero/display weights (300) and letter-spacing, the small-caps label treatment, and any @font-face / Google Fonts link in base.html at that commit; diff against the current files; put the original families, weights and tracking back everywhere they were (hero name, verdict figures, section headings, chips' small-caps labels, mono for codes), while keeping the 7-step size tokens, the single :root palette, form controls inheriting the font, and the overflow/stacking fixes. If the earlier files used a named display face via a Google Fonts link, restore that link in base.html. Update check_type_scale.py so it asserts the marque families (not the system stack) and the size tokens. Run check_type_scale.py, check_theme.py, check_screens.py, check_bench.py. Commit \"Typography: marque font faces restored (Alfa/Maserati/Ferrari design), size scale kept\" with the Co-Authored-By line, push, restart, confirm /api/health, report hash and the families now in force."},"uuid":"93e72cb8-d966-4103-bdec-ee3066048f27","timestamp":"2026-10-14T16:31:24.167Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
