{"parentUuid":"6f792b45-b528-4f93-95b4-a9077127d6e1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"343be13e-1207-460e-ba68-2e407ae8d554","agentId":"a09009e70701a4229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WQ4ySNqrU9erCZWyXXzVdv","type":"tool_result","content":"14\t/* ---------- 1. TYPE + COLOUR FOUNDATION (TYPE_AND_UI_AUDIT_2026-10-14 R1/R2) ----------\n15\t * One :root token block for dark (the default), one for light (the\n16\t * [data-theme=\"light\"] override and its prefers-color-scheme mirror carry\n17\t * the identical set of values -- that pair is a mechanism, not a duplicate).\n18\t * Every later \"additive pass\" in this file used to redeclare its own bare\n19\t * :root with a handful of overriding values (true-black bg/surface/ink,\n20\t * then a lone --ink-3, plus --space-*/--fam-* in their own blocks) -- that\n21\t * is exactly R2's \"colour tokens declared 3 times on :root\" and \"body\n22\t * font-size declared 4 times\" symptom. All of that is merged in here, at\n23\t * its final (last-cascade-wins) value, so there is now exactly one place\n24\t * to read any token's value. Component rules below are unchanged. */"}]},"uuid":"73fb52a1-ca08-4111-88d6-8c76c66ede8b","timestamp":"2026-10-14T16:48:59.951Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\web\\static\\cuore.css","content":"/* ---------- 1. TYPE + COLOUR FOUNDATION (TYPE_AND_UI_AUDIT_2026-10-14 R1/R2) ----------\n * One :root token block for dark (the default), one for light (the\n * [data-theme=\"light\"] override and its prefers-color-scheme mirror carry\n * the identical set of values -- that pair is a mechanism, not a duplicate).\n * Every later \"additive pass\" in this file used to redeclare its own bare\n * :root with a handful of overriding values (true-black bg/surface/ink,\n * then a lone --ink-3, plus --space-*/--fam-* in their own blocks) -- that\n * is exactly R2's \"colour tokens declared 3 times on :root\" and \"body\n * font-size declared 4 times\" symptom. All of that is merged in here, at\n * its final (last-cascade-wins) value, so there is now exactly one place\n * to read any token's value. Component rules below are unchanged. */","numLines":11,"startLine":14,"totalLines":1817}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6f792b45-b528-4f93-95b4-a9077127d6e1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
